  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Action Roll",
    "section": "6.3",
    "heading": "2. The Player Chooses the Action Rating",
    "lineStart": 326,
    "lineEnd": 328
  },
  "section": "6.3",
  "rulesText": "The player chooses which **action rating** to roll, following from what their character is doing on-screen. If you want to roll your **Skirmish** action, then get in a fight. If you want to roll your **Command** action, then order someone around. You can't roll a given action rating unless your character is presently performing that action in the fiction."
}
